# The go-trust image the conformance run trusts, PINNED by digest (never a
# moving tag): compose/go-trust.yml defaults GO_TRUST_IMAGE to `:latest`, and
# an invisible upstream re-push would change the trust service — and with it
# the verdict — between two runs of the same verifier commit.
#
# This is the digest the current baseline run validated (always-trusted
# registry mode, `--registry always-trusted`): the PDP whose AuthZEN answers
# the trust gate parses. Adopt a new go-trust deliberately, in one PR that
# reads its release notes and re-reads the parse contract in
# tunnelbana-plugin's `parse_authzen_response`.
go-trust-image: ghcr.io/sirosfoundation/go-trust@sha256:238f6f3adec65ec3950482c1173705a72db0a6d297f2fd1afa3a3eb3e847badc
